steps.body:
- Main: `/etc/nginx/nginx.conf` (http { include conf.d/*.conf; })
- Sites: `/etc/nginx/conf.d/*.conf` (RHEL) or `sites-available/` + symlink in `sites-enabled/` (Debian)
- Test: `nginx -t`; reload: `systemctl reload nginx`
```
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name promo.contoso.local;
    root /srv/promo;
    index index.html;
    access_log /var/log/nginx/promo.access.log;
}
```

```
location / {
    proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:3000;
    proxy_set_header Host $host;
    proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
    proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
    proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
    proxy_read_timeout 60s;
}
```
WebSockets also need `proxy_http_version 1.1` and Upgrade/Connection headers.

```
upstream orders_app {
    least_conn;
    server 10.20.4.61:8081 max_fails=3 fail_timeout=30s;
    server 10.20.4.62:8081 max_fails=3 fail_timeout=30s;
    keepalive 32;
}
server { location / { proxy_pass http://orders_app; proxy_http_version 1.1; proxy_set_header Connection ""; } }
```
- Methods: round-robin (default), `least_conn`, `ip_hash` (sticky by client IP)
- `backup` marks a standby server

```
server {
    listen 443 ssl;
    http2 on;
    server_name portal.contoso.local www.portal.contoso.local;
    ssl_certificate     /etc/pki/tls/certs/portal-fullchain.crt;
    ssl_certificate_key /etc/pki/tls/private/portal.key;
    ssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;
}
server { listen 80; server_name portal.contoso.local; return 301 https://$host$request_uri; }
```
fullchain = leaf **first**, then intermediates: `cat portal.crt ca-chain.crt > portal-fullchain.crt`

